		Text: The box
			Style: topic
		Heading 1:
			Text: Border style
		Paragraph: `Border style` draws the border with a solid line (the default), with dashes or with dots, the same on its four sides. The dashes are three times as long as the border is wide, the dots as wide as it, and each side starts and ends with a whole one.
